Output docs/demo/NAME.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 900
Set Height 540
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms

Hide
Type "make build >/dev/null && source docs/demo/env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "app --some-flag"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Hide
Type "q"
Show
